WEBVTT

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:03.980
FANSUB GROUP AZALIA PRESENTS

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:03.980
Worked on the series:
Lily, Tiramisu, Biryulka, Host, Pineapple

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:03.980
How did I become

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:03.980
queen

00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:06.430
All characters are fictitious

00:01:06.430 --> 00:01:08.530
and the events shown are fiction.

00:02:10.660 --> 00:02:11.760
So it was you.

00:02:12.660 --> 00:02:14.330
You were that person.

00:02:22.940 --> 00:02:24.510
I won't forgive you.

00:02:44.660 --> 00:02:47.400
I'll kill you.

00:03:42.720 --> 00:03:45.690
Episode 12: Dance on the Edge of the Sword

00:03:53.310 --> 00:03:56.710
Now I understand who is the boss in the palace?

00:04:04.550 --> 00:04:07.020
I almost shot you.
Mistaken for prey.

00:04:07.190 --> 00:04:09.290
Or maybe she missed by mistake?

00:04:10.290 --> 00:04:11.460
It's just a misunderstanding.

00:04:19.640 --> 00:04:21.470
Remember your place.

00:04:28.580 --> 00:04:30.680
I have to change my clothes.

00:04:30.680 --> 00:04:31.750
Yes, Your Majesty.

00:04:54.370 --> 00:04:56.370
There is a case for the Detective Department.

00:05:07.320 --> 00:05:09.290
Was it necessary to do this with Ovol?

00:05:13.460 --> 00:05:14.820
What did I do?

00:05:15.220 --> 00:05:17.360
Was it necessary to kill her?

00:05:17.660 --> 00:05:20.260
And then throw the dead one into the well?

00:05:20.630 --> 00:05:25.430
Did you have to do this to an innocent girl just to scare me?

00:05:25.640 --> 00:05:26.770
Did I kill her?

00:05:26.970 --> 00:05:28.910
Where does this misconception come from?

00:05:29.040 --> 00:05:30.510
I am generally against killing all living things,

00:05:30.510 --> 00:05:32.480
unless it's for cooking.

00:05:35.210 --> 00:05:37.910
The fact that her body was found in a well is either a terrible coincidence,

00:05:38.380 --> 00:05:40.520
or someone wants to push us.

00:05:41.750 --> 00:05:45.620
Deny further until my rage reaches its limit.

00:05:45.920 --> 00:05:49.130
You're driving me so crazy.
I definitely didn't do this.

00:05:49.130 --> 00:05:51.460
Why such a bad opinion about me?

00:05:51.660 --> 00:05:52.930
Because that's who you are.

00:05:53.230 --> 00:05:56.830
The Kim So-yeon I know is capable of just that.

00:05:57.370 --> 00:05:59.200
How do you know me?
what if I don’t know myself yet?

00:05:59.340 --> 00:06:03.440
The best liar lies to himself.

00:06:03.770 --> 00:06:06.510
You are deceiving yourself by saying that you don't know who you are.

00:06:12.010 --> 00:06:15.420
I think we've now passed the point of no return.

00:06:16.420 --> 00:06:19.160
I won't pay attention
to your misconceptions about me.

00:06:20.120 --> 00:06:21.460
Do whatever you want.

00:06:29.730 --> 00:06:30.770
Rabbit

00:06:43.950 --> 00:06:45.150
Who shot her?

00:06:45.150 --> 00:06:47.380
We chased her so much, so who dared...

00:06:55.420 --> 00:06:58.390
Looks like we have a winner. It's time to go back.

00:06:58.830 --> 00:07:00.130
-Yes, queen.
-Yes, queen.

00:07:15.410 --> 00:07:16.680
This is blood.

00:07:19.150 --> 00:07:20.520
This is rubbish.

00:07:21.680 --> 00:07:23.750
Are you completely crazy? It's incredibly painful.

00:07:24.320 --> 00:07:27.120
I'm sorry, my hand slipped.

00:07:27.660 --> 00:07:29.960
-Here's a small one...
-Are you okay, Your Majesty?

00:07:29.960 --> 00:07:32.330
Even with a soft tip, it still hurts.

00:07:32.700 --> 00:07:34.830
Your Highness, what are you...

00:07:41.440 --> 00:07:43.140
I'll repay you.

00:07:44.270 --> 00:07:46.010
You're dead.

00:07:51.710 --> 00:07:52.750
Seriously?

00:07:54.080 --> 00:07:57.620
For the sake of my dear husband, I will let her go today.

00:07:58.590 --> 00:08:00.560
-Because I'm in charge here.
-Of course, Your Majesty.

00:08:08.400 --> 00:08:09.970
Go to the Hijeongjong Hall.

00:08:10.430 --> 00:08:12.070
I'll help you change...

00:08:12.070 --> 00:08:14.170
Someone is trying to crash the feast,

00:08:15.140 --> 00:08:16.810
so I'll go alone.

00:08:51.570 --> 00:08:54.110
Everyone who is invited here today,

00:08:54.110 --> 00:08:56.580
will perceive the king
as one in authority.

00:08:57.010 --> 00:08:58.910
And everything that was said about him

00:08:58.910 --> 00:09:00.680
even the nickname of the woodcutter prince from Ganghwado,

00:09:00.780 --> 00:09:03.090
will turn into false rumors.

00:09:04.450 --> 00:09:07.090
The king insisted so much on the feast.

00:09:07.090 --> 00:09:08.460
Must have chosen this day

00:09:08.460 --> 00:09:10.790
to appear before the court in a new guise.

00:09:12.160 --> 00:09:13.830
How did you manage to blink

00:09:15.400 --> 00:09:17.930
his preparation?

00:09:20.200 --> 00:09:21.540
I'm sorry.

00:09:22.270 --> 00:09:23.270
However

00:09:23.910 --> 00:09:27.210
I also have something prepared for the king,

00:09:28.640 --> 00:09:30.080
so watch carefully.

00:09:32.550 --> 00:09:35.280
I hope you've prepared as well as you should.

00:09:43.690 --> 00:09:45.330
Concubine Hon.

00:09:46.060 --> 00:09:47.200
One point.

00:09:48.760 --> 00:09:51.530
Royal Concubine Cho. 2 points.

00:09:53.170 --> 00:09:54.770
Concubine Min.

00:09:56.370 --> 00:09:57.670
4 points.

00:09:58.570 --> 00:10:02.110
Concubine Yun. She also has 4 points.

00:10:04.610 --> 00:10:06.180
Queen.

00:10:09.250 --> 00:10:10.320
10 points.

00:10:11.190 --> 00:10:12.220
Wow!

00:10:16.030 --> 00:10:19.200
In the end, the queen won.

00:10:19.460 --> 00:10:22.260
The Queen Mother will present the award.

00:10:33.980 --> 00:10:36.710
She said that you would just enjoy the holiday.

00:10:36.850 --> 00:10:38.750
Practiced secretly?

00:10:38.910 --> 00:10:41.220
Like a born actor,

00:10:42.750 --> 00:10:44.990
I'm better at real games.

00:10:48.490 --> 00:10:51.030
Congratulations, Your Majesty.

00:10:51.030 --> 00:10:53.660
-Congratulations, Your Majesty.
-Congratulations, Your Majesty.

00:10:58.900 --> 00:11:00.200
What deceit.

00:11:01.100 --> 00:11:04.070
We must proceed to the palace for the feast.

00:11:04.410 --> 00:11:06.580
But we have a little time before we start,

00:11:06.580 --> 00:11:09.080
so you can rest for now.

00:11:09.080 --> 00:11:11.110
I'm sure you're tired after the hunt.

00:11:11.480 --> 00:11:13.720
-Yes, Queen Mother.
-Yes, Queen Mother.

00:11:21.460 --> 00:11:22.760
Is it very painful?

00:11:23.060 --> 00:11:25.130
What is this?

00:11:26.130 --> 00:11:28.600
Now I understand why Eunuch Kim was so afraid.

00:11:29.160 --> 00:11:31.170
Your Majesty, you need to return to Daejojeon Hall

00:11:31.170 --> 00:11:33.170
and dress appropriately for the feast.

00:11:33.170 --> 00:11:35.240
Exactly. And I'll take a break while I'm there.

00:11:35.240 --> 00:11:38.270
-Certainly.
-The back of my head still hurts.

00:11:38.270 --> 00:11:39.380
That's bad luck.

00:11:46.980 --> 00:11:49.220
Let's hurry. There is very little time before the feast.

00:11:58.890 --> 00:12:00.760
Why did she do this?

00:12:01.900 --> 00:12:04.600
I'm sure someone is trying to push us over.

00:12:05.330 --> 00:12:06.400
Who?

00:12:07.550 --> 00:12:09.840
Who knew that the well situation would ruin the relationship.

00:12:10.770 --> 00:12:14.680
There are always three problems in the palace.

00:12:15.410 --> 00:12:16.910
Women's hidden enmity

00:12:17.410 --> 00:12:20.220
power struggle among the court and

00:12:21.950 --> 00:12:22.990
death from poison.

00:12:26.290 --> 00:12:28.790
So that's why you keep mentioning poison?

00:12:28.890 --> 00:12:30.960
I lived in a palace for decades

00:12:31.260 --> 00:12:34.230
and saw many who died from various poisons.

00:12:35.860 --> 00:12:38.400
Deadly poison kills with one drop.

00:12:38.830 --> 00:12:40.100
Hidden Poisons

00:12:40.100 --> 00:12:42.140
They kill slowly under the guise of disease.

00:12:42.670 --> 00:12:44.570
And although they were not found,

00:12:45.040 --> 00:12:47.740
but I'm sure many deaths

00:12:47.740 --> 00:12:49.480
were due to poison.

00:12:50.210 --> 00:12:53.550
Yes, the palace is a very dangerous place.

00:12:56.150 --> 00:12:58.820
If you think about it that way, that person who looks like Han...

00:13:03.060 --> 00:13:04.260
Here he is. That guy.

00:13:04.390 --> 00:13:05.430
Let's hide.

00:13:07.000 --> 00:13:09.900
And then she turned around...

00:13:10.070 --> 00:13:12.900
Did she see my face? Don't think.

00:13:12.900 --> 00:13:14.340
That's why I ran away.

00:13:14.670 --> 00:13:16.270
-Are you sure?
-Yes.

00:13:16.270 --> 00:13:18.670
Gotcha.

00:13:24.810 --> 00:13:25.810
Court lady Choi.

00:13:26.020 --> 00:13:27.950
Go and find out who the man is

00:13:27.950 --> 00:13:28.980
I just spoke here.

00:13:30.290 --> 00:13:32.250
I bet my lost dragon balls

00:13:32.250 --> 00:13:34.560
that his last name is Khan.

00:13:35.320 --> 00:13:37.790
The feast will begin soon.

00:13:37.830 --> 00:13:39.130
It won't start

00:13:39.130 --> 00:13:40.800
while this guy is hanging around here.

00:13:41.160 --> 00:13:42.230
What?

00:13:43.530 --> 00:13:45.030
Then what about the royal chef?

00:13:45.730 --> 00:13:46.770
What a scoundrel.

00:13:49.940 --> 00:13:53.410
Why is everything similar to what I went through?

00:13:54.880 --> 00:13:57.280
And Cheoljong has no idea what’s going on here.

00:14:00.650 --> 00:14:03.290
To avoid regrets, people must live according to their status.

00:14:03.590 --> 00:14:05.850
But I'll be myself and won't bother.

00:14:09.160 --> 00:14:11.730
I'm sure he mixed something in the water.

00:14:13.600 --> 00:14:14.900
I?

00:14:17.200 --> 00:14:18.970
Come on!

00:14:19.200 --> 00:14:20.970
Even if the palace is a cruel place,

00:14:20.970 --> 00:14:23.610
Why would he ruin the feast with mass poisoning?

00:14:24.210 --> 00:14:25.270
Definitely not.

00:14:28.110 --> 00:14:30.780
Anxiety and fear are contagious.

00:14:30.780 --> 00:14:32.280
Damn it.

00:14:32.550 --> 00:14:33.680
Where are you going?

00:14:34.150 --> 00:14:36.490
To the crime scene for evidence.

00:14:36.590 --> 00:14:38.120
Well, you will come to Daejojeon.

00:14:38.150 --> 00:14:40.920
My mind is racing back and forth and my sense of direction is lost.

00:14:42.020 --> 00:14:43.590
Wait for me, Your Majesty!

00:15:07.550 --> 00:15:09.550
It kind of smells like grass.

00:15:10.650 --> 00:15:12.250
What did he add?

00:15:12.960 --> 00:15:14.120
And forget to think!

00:15:14.790 --> 00:15:15.890
Do you think so?

00:15:17.290 --> 00:15:18.730
We're all screwed.

00:15:19.800 --> 00:15:20.930
Sovereign!

00:15:23.330 --> 00:15:26.070
I did everything I could

00:15:26.070 --> 00:15:28.400
but the feast will begin soon,
but there are still no products.

00:15:29.040 --> 00:15:30.970
Sooner or later, they will be brought.

00:15:34.080 --> 00:15:35.780
Trust me and don't give up.

00:15:37.510 --> 00:15:40.150
I'll try to think of something.

00:15:54.160 --> 00:15:55.500
Give up already.

00:15:57.170 --> 00:15:58.870
Give in and you'll feel better.

00:15:59.600 --> 00:16:00.600
Queen.

00:16:01.070 --> 00:16:03.710
You understand that everything is doomed.

00:16:03.710 --> 00:16:05.810
No matter how hard you try,

00:16:05.810 --> 00:16:08.140
everything will end in pain.
Yours and your loved ones.

00:16:10.510 --> 00:16:13.520
So? I don't care about anything
and become an obedient doll?

00:16:16.990 --> 00:16:18.550
I can't live like this.

00:16:19.790 --> 00:16:22.930
I will try my best until the very end.

00:16:23.860 --> 00:16:26.060
If you're against it

00:16:27.660 --> 00:16:28.960
forget about me.

00:16:31.430 --> 00:16:34.240
Exactly! We're keeping our distance.

00:16:34.700 --> 00:16:36.000
Okay, everything is clear.

00:16:43.280 --> 00:16:46.450
Your Majesty,
Why are your words and actions different?

00:16:47.120 --> 00:16:48.280
What are you talking about?

00:16:48.650 --> 00:16:51.650
Even if I am talking bullshit,
then from the bottom of my heart.

00:16:51.750 --> 00:16:53.620
I've never lied to anyone in my life.

00:16:53.990 --> 00:16:55.820
You are worried about the king.

00:16:55.890 --> 00:16:58.260
Are you afraid that he will get hurt?
if it doesn't stop.

00:16:59.160 --> 00:17:00.400
Why?

00:17:00.800 --> 00:17:03.600
Care about the king and about celebrities -

00:17:03.600 --> 00:17:04.770
You can't imagine anything worse!

00:17:06.870 --> 00:17:09.440
Previously, every time
how you said some nonsense,

00:17:09.440 --> 00:17:11.270
it wasn't what you really thought.

00:17:37.600 --> 00:17:39.330
I knew there was poison in the water.

00:17:41.170 --> 00:17:43.170
You! Where is the royal chef?

00:17:44.370 --> 00:17:47.080
I was just here.

00:17:48.180 --> 00:17:49.240
No!

00:17:52.680 --> 00:17:54.080
Escaped, bastard?

00:17:54.380 --> 00:17:56.080
Conducted himself like a true professional

00:17:56.080 --> 00:17:57.350
and now he ran away?

00:17:57.490 --> 00:17:59.220
But what will happen to the feast?

00:17:59.990 --> 00:18:02.060
The king put so much effort into it.

00:18:02.120 --> 00:18:04.430
There are no products, and neither are the cooks.

00:18:05.690 --> 00:18:06.900
It's over.

00:18:08.700 --> 00:18:11.770
So? I don't care about anything
and become an obedient doll?

00:18:12.130 --> 00:18:13.600
I can't live like this.

00:18:14.900 --> 00:18:18.140
I will try my best until the very end.

00:18:19.710 --> 00:18:21.410
That's it!

00:18:23.050 --> 00:18:25.380
Hong Young, do something for me.

00:18:28.620 --> 00:18:30.090
Thanks for your service.

00:18:31.490 --> 00:18:32.920
Khan Simon

00:18:35.690 --> 00:18:37.330
Thanks again.

00:18:42.730 --> 00:18:44.800
What is the name of the man who just came out?

00:18:45.130 --> 00:18:46.440
Why do you need this?

00:18:47.140 --> 00:18:48.640
I have my reasons.

00:18:48.740 --> 00:18:50.210
I can't tell you.

00:18:54.240 --> 00:18:55.540
Horror.

00:18:55.780 --> 00:18:59.080
If you leave the queen alone at the feast,

00:18:59.650 --> 00:19:01.920
who knows what she will do?

00:19:03.550 --> 00:19:05.850
Hello!
Long time no see!

00:19:05.850 --> 00:19:07.620
I caught a cold here

00:19:08.490 --> 00:19:10.760
borrow it! Thank you.

00:19:31.350 --> 00:19:33.820
Rice! Rice! This is rice!

00:19:33.820 --> 00:19:37.420
-Rice!
-Rice! Look, rice!

00:19:37.420 --> 00:19:38.620
-Faster!
-Rice!

00:19:39.350 --> 00:19:40.620
-Rice!
-Grab it!

00:19:41.960 --> 00:19:44.090
-Collect!
-Faster!

00:19:44.290 --> 00:19:45.930
- Hurry!
-Collect it!

00:19:47.060 --> 00:19:48.260
-What's happened?
-What?

00:19:50.000 --> 00:19:51.270
Rice!

00:20:13.960 --> 00:20:17.160
This is my customer from the palace!

00:20:19.360 --> 00:20:22.900
It just so happened
that a lot of interesting things arrived today.

00:20:30.210 --> 00:20:31.640
I don't have time.

00:20:32.310 --> 00:20:33.780
You've made a mistake.

00:20:34.980 --> 00:20:36.010
What?

00:20:36.910 --> 00:20:37.980
I didn't identify myself.

00:20:58.300 --> 00:21:00.670
Why are there so many temptations today?

00:21:02.500 --> 00:21:05.240
Forget it
You are a court lady, control yourself.

00:21:21.720 --> 00:21:25.290
Court lady,
do you want to tell me something?

00:21:54.320 --> 00:21:55.920
All this time you've been hiding

00:21:55.920 --> 00:21:58.130
their abilities and did nothing useful.

00:21:58.530 --> 00:22:01.160
It must be hard to sit still.

00:22:01.700 --> 00:22:03.970
I'm already used to it. It's not difficult for me.

00:22:05.800 --> 00:22:06.870
Here's how.

00:22:40.300 --> 00:22:42.100
Hold it. Now everything is as it should be.

00:22:44.340 --> 00:22:48.680
Are you sure it's not you in the pictures?

00:22:48.680 --> 00:22:51.250
I already said it! It's not me!

00:22:51.510 --> 00:22:54.180
I won't lie, it's clear at first glance

00:22:54.180 --> 00:22:58.450
This guy's body looks exactly like mine.

00:22:58.890 --> 00:23:00.660
But, I'm sorry, it's not me.

00:23:01.790 --> 00:23:04.330
I am honored that the name of a similar man

00:23:04.330 --> 00:23:05.530
engraved on the kaleidoscope.

00:23:05.690 --> 00:23:08.330
Say it too! By the way,

00:23:09.160 --> 00:23:13.400
these days things like that
Are they in demand among servants?

00:23:14.400 --> 00:23:17.010
Words cannot describe how much

00:23:17.010 --> 00:23:19.840
ladies of the court love this kind of thing.

00:23:20.340 --> 00:23:23.910
Confused me. I didn't think I was so handsome.

00:23:25.410 --> 00:23:26.550
That's it.

00:23:27.220 --> 00:23:29.050
So you are Mr. Simon

00:23:29.990 --> 00:23:33.890
from the Han clan, and your full name is

00:23:33.890 --> 00:23:36.860
sounds like Khan Simon.

00:23:42.920 --> 00:23:44.120
Don't forget

00:23:44.960 --> 00:23:47.290
in the midst of the feast,

00:23:47.620 --> 00:23:50.390
when the king is at his strongest,

00:23:51.170 --> 00:23:53.860
It's time to make this public.

00:24:16.080 --> 00:24:17.380
Girl, listen.

00:24:21.000 --> 00:24:22.660
Do me a favor.

00:24:23.560 --> 00:24:26.200
Can you pass a note to someone?

00:24:28.670 --> 00:24:29.670
To whom?

00:24:35.010 --> 00:24:36.130
That person.

00:24:39.870 --> 00:24:41.250
Fine! Understood.

00:24:47.580 --> 00:24:48.660
Mister,

00:24:49.760 --> 00:24:53.760
this young gentleman asked
pass this on to you.

00:25:02.670 --> 00:25:05.060
I have to say something
putting the clan's honor on the line.

00:25:05.360 --> 00:25:06.780
I'll be waiting in the pavilion.

00:25:12.910 --> 00:25:14.040
I can't believe it.

00:25:15.480 --> 00:25:17.020
Did he notice something?

00:25:32.230 --> 00:25:33.320
You have arrived.

00:25:35.290 --> 00:25:36.630
I have a confession to make to you.

00:25:37.300 --> 00:25:39.270
I know it was rude to call you like that,

00:25:42.330 --> 00:25:46.140
but my family is as dear to me as life.

00:25:46.980 --> 00:25:47.980
However,

00:25:50.380 --> 00:25:54.190
after spending countless nights thinking,
I made up my mind.

00:25:55.580 --> 00:25:57.960
I decided to choose what is more important than my family.

00:25:59.280 --> 00:26:00.820
If the family is against it,

00:26:02.290 --> 00:26:03.470
then I

00:26:05.090 --> 00:26:06.360
I will refuse them.

00:26:07.240 --> 00:26:10.330
I want only me to be in your eyes from now on.

00:26:17.210 --> 00:26:21.780
Are you kidding me, or what?
I have enough to do without you!

00:26:27.490 --> 00:26:28.720
The girl is confused!

00:26:40.860 --> 00:26:42.390
What have I done?

00:26:48.180 --> 00:26:50.910
-My tummy, my tummy.
-It hurts so bad!

00:26:54.180 --> 00:26:57.340
-Stick out your tongue.
-I'm going to die right now.

00:26:58.380 --> 00:27:00.110
Stronger.

00:27:01.850 --> 00:27:02.920
My tummy, my tummy.

00:27:02.920 --> 00:27:05.350
You were all poisoned with some herbs.

00:27:10.090 --> 00:27:11.360
-It hurts so bad!
-How so?

00:27:13.360 --> 00:27:17.440
I think someone slipped it
ground bird knotweed.

00:27:17.440 --> 00:27:18.510
Guys!

00:27:19.240 --> 00:27:21.210
-What?
-I'm dying!

00:27:21.210 --> 00:27:22.210
What's happened?

00:27:24.340 --> 00:27:25.750
Why are you here?

00:27:25.750 --> 00:27:28.040
The queen sent for me.

00:27:28.640 --> 00:27:31.190
She ordered me to test the water.

00:27:31.340 --> 00:27:34.050
Someone put herbs in the water,
causing abdominal pain.

00:27:35.920 --> 00:27:38.780
Damn it! And there are problems with water.

00:27:40.350 --> 00:27:42.430
Why don't you ride with your belly?

00:27:42.430 --> 00:27:44.590
As far as I can see,
I'm a very nervous person.

00:27:44.590 --> 00:27:46.670
And when I’m worried, I don’t take a drop in my mouth.

00:27:46.670 --> 00:27:48.860
You can see
that you are one of those who, even on the field,

00:27:48.860 --> 00:27:51.270
where there is a battle, sleep like a dead man.

00:27:51.270 --> 00:27:53.800
Look at him, he calls himself a doctor,
and there’s not a boom-boom in people.

00:27:53.800 --> 00:27:55.800
I am a healer, not a physiognomist.

00:27:56.870 --> 00:28:00.140
I am, of course, an experienced doctor,

00:28:00.610 --> 00:28:04.220
but even I won’t be able to get them back on their feet until tomorrow.

00:28:04.340 --> 00:28:08.350
Even if they bring food,
then with this brotherhood of the orphaned and wretched...

00:28:09.220 --> 00:28:10.880
Who the hell did this?

00:28:17.890 --> 00:28:19.290
I haven't seen him before.

00:28:22.830 --> 00:28:24.510
Did you add the poison?

00:28:34.280 --> 00:28:37.280
His Majesty sent me, a guest chef,

00:28:37.280 --> 00:28:38.610
to prepare the feast.

00:28:40.810 --> 00:28:42.350
My name is Lee Senman.

00:28:43.050 --> 00:28:45.460
I've come to help you.

00:28:45.780 --> 00:28:46.820
Catch it.

00:28:50.530 --> 00:28:52.230
No brainer, this is the queen.

00:28:52.970 --> 00:28:54.060
Agree?

00:28:54.360 --> 00:28:56.500
Nonsense! Why do you call him queen?

00:28:56.560 --> 00:28:59.410
Damn, what's wrong with your eyes?

00:28:59.410 --> 00:29:03.030
The Queen is busy dancing. Why would she be here?

00:29:03.180 --> 00:29:04.870
Formally,

00:29:04.870 --> 00:29:07.520
she's at a feast now, you know?

00:29:07.840 --> 00:29:10.340
Now it's clear.

00:29:11.750 --> 00:29:12.780
Tomato?

00:29:13.040 --> 00:29:15.260
What are you talking about?

00:29:15.380 --> 00:29:18.880
This is a persimmon that only lives for a year.

00:29:18.880 --> 00:29:20.660
What kind of backwoods are you from, brat?

00:29:20.660 --> 00:29:22.620
How can a chef not know this?

00:29:23.000 --> 00:29:25.730
How dare you call me a brat?

00:29:25.730 --> 00:29:28.030
We're both chefs. I call it whatever I want.

00:29:28.200 --> 00:29:30.030
-Is it true?
-Of course, brat!

00:29:30.030 --> 00:29:32.130
Hey, this is out of place.

00:29:32.130 --> 00:29:34.030
You abandoned the kitchen and ran away.

00:29:34.030 --> 00:29:35.100
What kind of chef are you?

00:29:35.100 --> 00:29:36.280
What are you talking about?

00:29:36.280 --> 00:29:38.300
I went to Nanonpo to find groceries

00:29:38.300 --> 00:29:39.710
to relieve abdominal pain.

00:29:40.610 --> 00:29:41.640
Nanonpo?

00:29:41.640 --> 00:29:43.780
Yes, to the royal farm.

00:29:43.780 --> 00:29:44.950
You don't know anything.

00:29:48.460 --> 00:29:49.920
Show me what you brought.

00:29:55.090 --> 00:29:58.700
Cooking begins with selection
high quality products.

00:30:00.590 --> 00:30:02.740
And on the royal farm

00:30:02.740 --> 00:30:04.740
Do they raise chickens too?

00:30:05.910 --> 00:30:08.480
If you bring some eggs, I can cook something.

00:30:23.020 --> 00:30:25.050
Your stomach is already growling.

00:30:25.050 --> 00:30:27.320
You haven't eaten since yesterday in order to break away today.

00:30:27.320 --> 00:30:29.390
Once you understand this,

00:30:29.390 --> 00:30:31.360
That means I haven’t eaten anything since yesterday.

00:30:38.210 --> 00:30:40.780
The feast you asked for

00:30:40.780 --> 00:30:42.710
will start soon.

00:30:44.640 --> 00:30:46.180
I'm looking forward to it.

00:31:11.410 --> 00:31:13.670
Each banquet at the Blue House was themed,

00:31:14.480 --> 00:31:17.210
because this is politics, not just food.

00:31:19.300 --> 00:31:20.870
What to cook?

00:31:22.110 --> 00:31:23.920
What is the purpose of this banquet?

00:31:27.960 --> 00:31:28.990
What is this?

00:31:29.350 --> 00:31:31.350
The menu was prepared by the king himself.

00:31:31.350 --> 00:31:33.960
And this is the full list of guests.

00:31:36.390 --> 00:31:38.790
So this is the boner menu everyone was talking about?

00:31:42.200 --> 00:31:44.360
I will create a new menu from these products.

00:32:00.420 --> 00:32:01.610
How did it go?

00:32:02.520 --> 00:32:03.690
Sorry.

00:32:04.690 --> 00:32:07.700
I spoke with the robbers, but they were not the ones hunting for food.

00:32:47.390 --> 00:32:48.940
Finally, the feast begins.

00:33:01.920 --> 00:33:03.480
This is a royal feast.

00:33:03.920 --> 00:33:06.690
Will only one dish be served?

00:33:07.110 --> 00:33:09.280
This is not a royal meal.

00:33:09.550 --> 00:33:11.160
Can't be. This is all?

00:33:11.280 --> 00:33:13.460
I'm sure there will be more dishes.

00:33:13.460 --> 00:33:16.820
Your Majesty, can you explain?

00:33:17.090 --> 00:33:19.470
People suffer from hunger every year.

00:33:19.770 --> 00:33:22.060
Some even die.

00:33:23.030 --> 00:33:25.270
To remind them of their suffering,

00:33:25.800 --> 00:33:28.600
They prepared a modest meal for you for the common people.

00:33:29.630 --> 00:33:31.140
With all due respect,

00:33:31.140 --> 00:33:33.840
The word "modest" doesn't fit here.

00:33:34.110 --> 00:33:36.840
You wanted to inform the officials

00:33:36.950 --> 00:33:39.340
but this cannot be served to nobles,

00:33:39.340 --> 00:33:41.350
who came to the feast from afar.

00:33:41.350 --> 00:33:42.490
Agree.

00:33:42.720 --> 00:33:45.080
Serve this dish to invited guests

00:33:45.620 --> 00:33:47.190
akin to punishment.

00:33:48.030 --> 00:33:51.470
You may have expected different food, but hopefully...

00:33:52.730 --> 00:33:54.330
you will understand what I wanted to show.

00:34:07.370 --> 00:34:08.950
30 minutes before

00:34:11.240 --> 00:34:12.680
Let's pierce it with a needle like this.

00:34:13.720 --> 00:34:15.080
What is this scribble?

00:34:15.620 --> 00:34:17.790
Throw in the potatoes. I'll show you how to do it.

00:34:49.010 --> 00:34:51.350
Finally the needle came in handy.

00:34:54.390 --> 00:34:56.100
Heat the oil.

00:34:58.660 --> 00:34:59.700
Oil?

00:35:05.260 --> 00:35:07.870
How dare you fry my igloo?

00:35:07.970 --> 00:35:10.010
Calm down. I'll sterilize her.

00:35:10.410 --> 00:35:11.740
Do you even know what it means?

00:35:12.040 --> 00:35:14.870
A mentor gave it to me 50 years ago.

00:35:15.120 --> 00:35:16.350
Calm down.

00:35:16.350 --> 00:35:18.990
50 years? Well, that's it, her deadline is up.

00:35:19.310 --> 00:35:20.810
No! I need her!

00:35:20.810 --> 00:35:22.490
I will pass it on to my student!

00:35:22.760 --> 00:35:23.910
Don't you dare put her down!

00:35:31.890 --> 00:35:32.930
That's it.

00:35:40.060 --> 00:35:42.680
It looks beautiful and harmonious with a needle in the middle.

00:35:42.680 --> 00:35:46.140
In this way, even the core will quickly cook.

00:35:47.850 --> 00:35:51.790
How did you come up with such a great idea?

00:35:51.790 --> 00:35:53.890
Speed ​​is key when cooking street food.

00:35:54.060 --> 00:35:56.120
Ideal for such an urgent situation.

00:35:57.010 --> 00:35:58.030
Street?

00:35:58.450 --> 00:36:00.850
It looks like a war zone.

00:36:01.490 --> 00:36:03.620
She survived the brutal battle.

00:36:08.330 --> 00:36:09.370
Here you go.

00:36:11.430 --> 00:36:12.640
Peel the potatoes.

00:36:12.760 --> 00:36:13.930
I?

00:36:14.580 --> 00:36:15.910
Who else?

00:36:19.640 --> 00:36:20.970
Need rice candy?

00:36:22.970 --> 00:36:25.140
I was sent to check how things were going.

00:36:44.060 --> 00:36:45.470
Clean more carefully.

00:36:47.410 --> 00:36:49.830
Slice as thin as possible. Even thinner.

00:36:49.830 --> 00:36:50.970
Like this.

00:36:51.040 --> 00:36:53.100
The tip is sharper. Even sharper.

00:36:53.140 --> 00:36:54.720
We'll use it to pierce potatoes.

00:36:54.970 --> 00:36:56.680
Well done.

00:36:57.720 --> 00:36:59.410
-The flame is too big.
-Fine.

00:37:00.810 --> 00:37:02.990
-And here you need to be stronger.
-Fine.

00:37:04.010 --> 00:37:06.720
Great. Remember everything.

00:37:07.600 --> 00:37:10.450
Today we are preparing more than just food.

00:37:11.430 --> 00:37:13.790
This is the face of the president.

00:37:20.410 --> 00:37:24.540
That is, the face of His Majesty.

00:37:33.080 --> 00:37:35.760
Is that okay, Your Majesty?

00:37:36.260 --> 00:37:37.930
That is, a cook.

00:37:39.160 --> 00:37:40.330
Let's see.

00:37:42.430 --> 00:37:44.560
Well done.

00:37:49.700 --> 00:37:52.910
I hope Cheoljong will understand the underlying idea.

00:38:08.010 --> 00:38:11.350
Is this the humble food of ordinary people?

00:38:11.350 --> 00:38:14.760
But I don’t know what ordinary people eat?

00:38:17.660 --> 00:38:19.760
Potatoes "Spiral"

00:38:28.080 --> 00:38:29.740
My intention was noble

00:38:30.370 --> 00:38:34.040
however, I must respect my guests.

00:38:34.450 --> 00:38:36.950
Therefore, simple products were used,

00:38:37.240 --> 00:38:39.350
but they are prepared in a new way.

00:38:40.640 --> 00:38:44.950
The first dish of the feast is potatoes.

00:38:45.830 --> 00:38:47.060
Are these potatoes?

00:38:49.790 --> 00:38:51.120
These are no ordinary potatoes.

00:38:51.830 --> 00:38:52.970
The dish is called...

00:38:55.990 --> 00:38:57.290
Squirms

00:38:58.700 --> 00:38:59.760
how's the spring?

00:39:02.870 --> 00:39:04.040
Spiral Potatoes!

00:39:04.540 --> 00:39:05.580
Fine.

00:39:05.580 --> 00:39:07.810
Reminds me of a dragon's whiskers.

00:39:07.810 --> 00:39:09.240
It's called "Spiral".

00:39:10.740 --> 00:39:12.640
A happy dish for a happy day.

00:39:12.640 --> 00:39:14.350
It's just a potato.

00:39:14.350 --> 00:39:17.160
Dragon? You're exaggerating, Your Majesty.

00:39:17.560 --> 00:39:19.220
If there were no potatoes,

00:39:19.220 --> 00:39:21.450
we would lose more lives.

00:39:22.260 --> 00:39:23.760
Country potatoes

00:39:23.760 --> 00:39:26.390
Grows even in barren soil and is easily stored.

00:39:26.600 --> 00:39:29.200
It is the staple food during barley growing.

00:39:29.760 --> 00:39:33.430
A sacred life-saving product.

00:39:33.810 --> 00:39:36.010
It's not "just a potato."

00:39:37.640 --> 00:39:38.740
Try the dish.

00:39:57.350 --> 00:40:00.030
Go crazy. Very tasty.

00:40:00.600 --> 00:40:02.260
I've never eaten anything like this.

00:40:03.700 --> 00:40:07.540
The right adviser seems to be completely hungry.

00:40:16.470 --> 00:40:17.740
Are these potatoes?

00:40:30.330 --> 00:40:33.220
There are three seasonings in front of you.

00:40:33.220 --> 00:40:35.640
Green is pine salt from the Namyang Khon family.

00:40:36.060 --> 00:40:38.810
It was made from sea salt and pine needles

00:40:38.810 --> 00:40:40.200
at Hwaseong Palace.

00:40:41.740 --> 00:40:44.870
Light red powder - grape sugar.

00:40:45.540 --> 00:40:47.540
Sugar? It would be better if they grew barley.

00:40:48.240 --> 00:40:50.370
With such delicious food there is no need to worry,

00:40:50.370 --> 00:40:52.410
all difficulties will be resolved.

00:40:54.120 --> 00:40:57.160
Crushed iris mixed with wild grapes.

00:40:57.990 --> 00:40:59.660
Grapes were harvested on Mount Camaksan

00:40:59.660 --> 00:41:01.660
on the territory of the Phapyeong clan Yun.

00:41:01.660 --> 00:41:03.720
It gives sugar a beautiful color and aroma.

00:41:04.790 --> 00:41:07.100
The yellow sauce is made from peaches.

00:41:07.620 --> 00:41:09.700
The best peaches were selected

00:41:09.700 --> 00:41:12.160
from Yoju, where the Yohyn clan of Min lives.

00:41:13.040 --> 00:41:16.830
The theme of today's feast is harmony.

00:41:18.910 --> 00:41:21.040
Politics divides people

00:41:21.040 --> 00:41:24.180
but delicious food unites them.

00:41:24.620 --> 00:41:28.080
I hope you can feel the harmony of the three births,

00:41:28.490 --> 00:41:30.290
joining us today.

00:41:40.470 --> 00:41:43.470
I chop and roast sweet potatoes, zucchini and eggplant.

00:41:43.470 --> 00:41:45.370
I will make a vegetable stew in whole tomatoes

00:41:45.370 --> 00:41:46.870
with broth and eggs.

00:41:48.510 --> 00:41:49.640
Such an unusual idea

00:41:49.640 --> 00:41:52.200
how to eat the vessel itself will drive them crazy.

00:41:55.180 --> 00:41:56.310
Not finished yet?

00:41:57.010 --> 00:41:58.120
Where there?

00:41:58.120 --> 00:42:00.680
I ground the barley and beans into powder.

00:42:00.680 --> 00:42:03.560
I have every possible type of powder and I mix and mix them.

00:42:04.350 --> 00:42:08.260
The dish you are preparing now will be the highlight of the feast.

00:42:08.260 --> 00:42:09.260
Fine.

00:42:11.990 --> 00:42:14.470
What are you doing? Knead more vigorously, like me.

00:42:15.430 --> 00:42:18.760
It is harmful to the joints of the shoulders and wrists.

00:42:18.760 --> 00:42:21.330
Come on. Use more force. Do it.

00:42:21.330 --> 00:42:24.040
Work your shoulders and wrists if necessary.

00:42:24.040 --> 00:42:25.870
Press the dough.

00:42:29.180 --> 00:42:31.510
Teacher, everything is ready.

00:42:31.510 --> 00:42:32.510
Is it true?

00:42:33.580 --> 00:42:35.890
Fine.

00:42:36.350 --> 00:42:38.720
No matter how you look at it, it's a feast. No way without meat.

00:42:39.220 --> 00:42:41.080
Our main course concludes with -

00:42:41.080 --> 00:42:42.830
hamburger with vegan steak.

00:43:01.370 --> 00:43:05.120
McDonald's

00:43:05.120 --> 00:43:06.720
Edible tomato vessel.

00:43:07.180 --> 00:43:08.490
Red color of tomato

00:43:08.490 --> 00:43:10.950
on Cart Day drives away bad luck

00:43:10.950 --> 00:43:12.890
and evil spirits.

00:43:20.970 --> 00:43:22.640
What a delicate taste!

00:43:30.200 --> 00:43:31.350
Is this a meat cutlet?

00:43:31.680 --> 00:43:34.450
Impossible. The meat could not be delivered...

00:43:37.140 --> 00:43:40.640
I wanted to say that it is difficult to get meat now.

00:43:42.850 --> 00:43:44.490
There is one Chinese proverb:

00:43:44.490 --> 00:43:46.220
"There is dragon meat in the sky,

00:43:46.220 --> 00:43:47.890
and on earth - from monkeys."

00:43:48.160 --> 00:43:51.930
And we will add: “Bean meat in hard times.”

00:43:52.560 --> 00:43:56.640
With barley and beans we will grow a belly.

00:43:56.990 --> 00:43:59.810
This is the essence of McDonald's.

00:44:00.260 --> 00:44:01.930
McDonald's.

00:44:04.140 --> 00:44:08.140
Nourishing and tasty, just like real meat.

00:44:08.870 --> 00:44:10.140
There's something to it.

00:44:43.780 --> 00:44:44.850
How beautiful.

00:44:45.240 --> 00:44:48.490
Decorate with flowers, and the cooled sweet jelly will be ready.

00:44:48.490 --> 00:44:49.790
A treat for the eyes.

00:44:50.310 --> 00:44:53.030
Desserts should be tasty and beautiful.

00:44:55.430 --> 00:44:56.950
-Marvelous.
-Just look at these colors.

00:44:56.950 --> 00:44:59.430
And finally, let’s make everyone say “wow.”

00:44:59.720 --> 00:45:01.700
The perfect end to a party.

00:45:12.470 --> 00:45:13.810
Good Luck Jelly

00:45:13.810 --> 00:45:15.240
Beautiful, of course

00:45:15.240 --> 00:45:17.850
but it's just regular jelly.

00:45:18.040 --> 00:45:22.220
I guess you didn't have enough for more.

00:45:24.390 --> 00:45:26.930
The stick makes eating jelly much more convenient.

00:45:27.390 --> 00:45:29.120
She will also predict your luck.

00:45:29.620 --> 00:45:30.620
Good luck?

00:45:30.850 --> 00:45:32.620
This dish is like a new beginning

00:45:32.620 --> 00:45:35.830
That's why it's called good luck jelly.

00:45:36.470 --> 00:45:40.010
I hope your future is successful, like a new beginning.

00:45:46.010 --> 00:45:49.720
Maybe we can end our feast by finding out our luck?

00:45:50.310 --> 00:45:54.140
How can we do something like this in a sacred palace?

00:45:58.580 --> 00:45:59.790
One more

00:46:01.180 --> 00:46:02.290
One more.

00:46:02.290 --> 00:46:03.350
Another?

00:46:05.260 --> 00:46:07.120
"Try next time."

00:46:11.140 --> 00:46:13.930
Loser

00:46:18.920 --> 00:46:21.220
How my back hurts.

00:46:24.520 --> 00:46:26.030
I'll lay back right now.

00:46:29.900 --> 00:46:32.970
I put my soul into these dishes, not the ingredients.

00:46:33.200 --> 00:46:35.240
I'm going to die now.

00:46:37.770 --> 00:46:39.070
We did it.

00:46:39.670 --> 00:46:40.910
We were able to.

00:46:43.910 --> 00:46:45.780
Do you know what I'm thinking about now?

00:46:47.650 --> 00:46:50.250
I know. I feel the same way.

00:46:52.550 --> 00:46:54.120
-Fish cutlets.
-What?

00:46:54.690 --> 00:46:56.320
I'm thinking about fish cakes.

00:46:58.690 --> 00:47:01.090
The cook who almost died at the hands of Emperor Qin Shi Huang,

00:47:01.090 --> 00:47:03.260
cooked the fish cakes the night before.

00:47:03.260 --> 00:47:05.530
I thought he was just lucky.

00:47:06.230 --> 00:47:07.370
But no.

00:47:07.570 --> 00:47:08.600
He prepared them

00:47:08.600 --> 00:47:10.640
struggling to survive.

00:47:10.870 --> 00:47:12.340
Inspiration -

00:47:12.340 --> 00:47:14.340
this is not something ordinary that comes,

00:47:14.440 --> 00:47:15.880
when you give up.

00:47:17.180 --> 00:47:18.310
Your Majesty.

00:47:19.350 --> 00:47:20.410
Your Majesty.

00:47:22.280 --> 00:47:24.790
Well, why were you in such a hurry!

00:47:24.790 --> 00:47:28.460
Here. There's some water here. Have a drink.

00:47:33.960 --> 00:47:35.800
Queen, his last name is Khan.

00:47:36.360 --> 00:47:38.500
Is it true? Is his last name really Khan?

00:47:38.500 --> 00:47:39.530
Yes.

00:47:40.300 --> 00:47:41.640
His name is Simon.

00:47:41.770 --> 00:47:43.270
His name is Khan Simon.

00:47:43.300 --> 00:47:45.810
Simon? What is his name as a foreigner?

00:47:48.680 --> 00:47:50.880
Khan Simon.

00:47:51.380 --> 00:47:52.380
Yes.

00:47:53.810 --> 00:47:55.420
What is this?

00:47:55.420 --> 00:47:57.680
Oh no. Nothing like that.

00:47:59.320 --> 00:48:01.020
While I was outside the palace,

00:48:01.020 --> 00:48:02.890
I reached Hanseongbu

00:48:02.890 --> 00:48:05.160
and looked through their family register.

00:48:07.390 --> 00:48:10.230
I'm sure this family registry is fake.

00:48:11.670 --> 00:48:15.070
I didn’t expect anything else from Director Han’s ancestors.

00:48:15.300 --> 00:48:17.100
We expelled him for false identity,

00:48:17.100 --> 00:48:19.710
So he decided to win over him in such a dirty way?

00:48:19.710 --> 00:48:22.080
Queen, you shouldn't stay here.

00:48:22.180 --> 00:48:24.040
You've been away for a long time already.

00:48:24.040 --> 00:48:25.180
Exactly.

00:48:25.410 --> 00:48:26.780
Well done, Lady Choi.

00:48:26.780 --> 00:48:28.820
-Let's go quickly.
-Your Majesty.

00:48:28.820 --> 00:48:30.480
-Wait.
- Be careful.

00:48:30.480 --> 00:48:31.520
Your Majesty.

00:48:33.690 --> 00:48:35.520
Your Majesty.

00:48:35.920 --> 00:48:37.020
Your Majesty.

00:48:37.920 --> 00:48:40.460
What? What's happened?

00:48:43.630 --> 00:48:45.230
My belly...

00:48:46.870 --> 00:48:49.540
It's like a whole band is playing drums in my stomach.

00:48:50.300 --> 00:48:51.510
What's happening?

00:48:53.010 --> 00:48:54.070
Water...

00:48:54.910 --> 00:48:57.480
Has anyone changed the water?

00:48:57.480 --> 00:48:59.850
What's wrong with this

00:49:00.910 --> 00:49:02.050
water?

00:49:02.320 --> 00:49:04.420
This water has been poisoned.

00:49:04.950 --> 00:49:06.920
I?

00:49:08.260 --> 00:49:09.490
I?

00:49:10.320 --> 00:49:11.320
Court lady!

00:49:13.430 --> 00:49:14.930
I see you have arrived.

00:49:16.030 --> 00:49:17.400
Of course he came.

00:49:18.630 --> 00:49:22.100
This is a feast in honor of the queen's recovery.

00:49:22.400 --> 00:49:24.240
From now on, keep your eyes open.

00:49:24.870 --> 00:49:27.810
Observe the results of your actions.

00:49:40.820 --> 00:49:42.020
God.

00:49:43.090 --> 00:49:46.130
Cooking turned out to be harder than I thought.

00:49:47.530 --> 00:49:50.330
Every inch of my body hurts.

00:49:51.100 --> 00:49:55.670
Also, the royal cook kept shouting at me.

00:49:56.570 --> 00:49:59.470
-This bastard.
- Hurry here!

00:50:02.710 --> 00:50:04.440
Still need to peel potatoes?

00:50:04.440 --> 00:50:07.010
Help court lady Choi.

00:50:07.050 --> 00:50:08.180
I beg you.

00:50:20.590 --> 00:50:21.830
Keep up the good work.

00:50:27.270 --> 00:50:28.400
Sorry.

00:50:38.410 --> 00:50:39.980
Was wearing a tokkaebi mask

00:50:40.810 --> 00:50:42.880
and he has an old scar on his face.

00:50:49.960 --> 00:50:51.020
Sorry.

00:50:59.170 --> 00:51:00.230
God.

00:51:01.430 --> 00:51:02.500
I'm sorry.

00:51:24.460 --> 00:51:27.730
Look, she is in pain.

00:51:28.130 --> 00:51:30.700
Do acupuncture, cauterize with herbs, do something.

00:51:30.700 --> 00:51:32.730
And give her the antidote.

00:51:32.730 --> 00:51:35.300
Hey, mind your own business.

00:51:35.440 --> 00:51:37.270
I am the boss in this area.

00:51:45.750 --> 00:51:47.310
I obey.

00:51:47.550 --> 00:51:49.480
You were terrible in the royal kitchen

00:51:49.480 --> 00:51:51.420
but in the royal hospital you are perfect.

00:51:52.450 --> 00:51:54.720
Whether it's a person or an object,

00:51:54.720 --> 00:51:56.990
everyone should be in their place.

00:51:58.860 --> 00:52:01.330
Your needle works better in the kitchen.

00:52:01.330 --> 00:52:02.330
It's not like that!

00:52:02.330 --> 00:52:04.530
This needle is ideal for piercing potatoes.

00:52:04.530 --> 00:52:05.630
Let me use it.

00:52:05.770 --> 00:52:07.200
How dare you whittle her! Never.

00:52:07.200 --> 00:52:08.970
This is ideal for peeling potatoes.

00:52:08.970 --> 00:52:11.540
-Give it to me.
-No.

00:52:11.540 --> 00:52:13.270
You can't, Your Majesty!

00:52:20.850 --> 00:52:25.750
The dancing in my stomach stopped.

00:52:27.520 --> 00:52:29.160
I shouldn't be here.

00:52:30.560 --> 00:52:32.260
-Your Majesty.
-Court Lady Choi!

00:52:32.530 --> 00:52:35.700
There was no way she could have recovered so quickly.

00:52:39.630 --> 00:52:41.600
She is a strong woman.

00:52:53.110 --> 00:52:54.310
She smells like oil.

00:52:54.310 --> 00:52:56.480
Why were you gone for so long?

00:52:57.250 --> 00:52:59.120
Well, the thing is...

00:52:59.150 --> 00:53:00.290
My apologies.

00:53:01.120 --> 00:53:03.060
My hand slipped

00:53:03.320 --> 00:53:05.490
and my arrow hit the queen.

00:53:06.930 --> 00:53:10.500
Are you injured?

00:53:10.760 --> 00:53:12.670
No, I'm fine.

00:53:13.100 --> 00:53:15.000
The hunt was so tiring

00:53:15.000 --> 00:53:17.670
that I fell asleep while preparations were underway.

00:53:17.840 --> 00:53:18.910
Look what.

00:53:34.190 --> 00:53:35.360
Apron?

00:53:44.160 --> 00:53:46.930
When will your preparations work?

00:53:47.030 --> 00:53:48.500
Wait.

00:53:48.770 --> 00:53:51.370
The king put so much effort into this feast.

00:53:51.840 --> 00:53:54.840
He should be the center of attention now.

00:54:18.530 --> 00:54:21.000
All who came here as scientists must set an example

00:54:21.400 --> 00:54:23.140
moderation in food,

00:54:23.140 --> 00:54:25.640
to show that you understand that people are starving.

00:54:26.040 --> 00:54:28.840
I'll take this opportunity to make an announcement.

00:54:31.540 --> 00:54:33.150
Since this feast,

00:54:33.710 --> 00:54:35.220
we will reduce the number of items in our meals.

00:54:36.780 --> 00:54:38.050
Fewer dishes?

00:54:38.950 --> 00:54:41.020
What nonsense is he talking about?

00:54:41.120 --> 00:54:44.190
When times are difficult in a country,

00:54:44.190 --> 00:54:46.830
the king must end up with some of the dishes,

00:54:46.990 --> 00:54:48.800
to share the pain of his people.

00:54:49.160 --> 00:54:53.430
By reducing the number of dishes, we feel the pain of our people,

00:54:53.730 --> 00:54:55.570
and we can overcome everything together.

00:54:56.370 --> 00:55:00.070
In times like these, selecting grain to please a dozen people

00:55:00.070 --> 00:55:02.880
and delight your insides with a piece of meat -

00:55:03.380 --> 00:55:04.510
sin.

00:55:05.580 --> 00:55:08.150
As a result, those who are in the palace

00:55:08.380 --> 00:55:11.580
If they serve meat on the table, they will be punished.

00:55:14.220 --> 00:55:17.760
I prohibit not only meat, but also any expensive food.

00:55:18.220 --> 00:55:21.530
Ministers should not enjoy drinking, singing and dancing,

00:55:21.960 --> 00:55:23.830
and must stop the struggle of clans for power.

00:55:24.730 --> 00:55:26.270
Those who do not accept these conditions,

00:55:27.170 --> 00:55:30.140
I will consider them thirsty for punishment.

00:55:32.470 --> 00:55:33.610
Your Majesty.

00:55:47.090 --> 00:55:49.290
I, Kim Jwageun, please forgive me.

00:55:49.460 --> 00:55:52.030
for bad news.

00:56:24.720 --> 00:56:26.490
These criminals lied about their status

00:56:26.490 --> 00:56:28.260
and hid in the royal guard.

00:56:29.400 --> 00:56:31.330
To carry out your orders and serve you,

00:56:31.330 --> 00:56:33.130
they used false identities.

00:56:35.170 --> 00:56:38.340
The time has come to deal with those he is hiding.

00:56:38.500 --> 00:56:40.470
I'm sure he believes that the basis of his power is those

00:56:40.470 --> 00:56:42.340
whom he cared for and protected well.

00:56:42.780 --> 00:56:45.350
We must nip this in the bud.

00:56:47.280 --> 00:56:49.250
So that he will never rise again.

00:57:12.310 --> 00:57:15.280
Do you have to ruin this important day?

00:57:15.280 --> 00:57:18.010
Do you know who they really are?

00:57:19.410 --> 00:57:21.580
Some of the families guilty of treason.

00:57:21.580 --> 00:57:24.180
Others are bandits who attacked scholar-officials,

00:57:24.180 --> 00:57:26.690
and some are wanted for open calls against the authorities.

00:57:27.020 --> 00:57:29.920
They are all opponents of the royal court,

00:57:29.920 --> 00:57:31.460
but they, disguised,

00:57:31.460 --> 00:57:33.930
guarded Your Majesty.

00:57:34.060 --> 00:57:36.160
Their ultimate goal is to stage a coup.

00:57:36.460 --> 00:57:38.460
Due to the urgency of the matter, I had no choice,

00:57:38.460 --> 00:57:40.400
except to inform Your Majesty immediately.

00:57:45.240 --> 00:57:46.310
This can't be true.

00:57:46.310 --> 00:57:49.510
Someone is falsely accusing my guards

00:57:49.840 --> 00:57:53.150
to weaken my defenses and harm me.

00:57:53.650 --> 00:57:54.880
Who are you

00:57:56.320 --> 00:57:58.650
do you mean by someone?

00:57:58.820 --> 00:58:02.560
You, troop commander Kim Jwageun.

00:58:09.000 --> 00:58:10.360
This is how you behave

00:58:10.360 --> 00:58:13.700
thinking that these three kinds will support you?

00:58:14.630 --> 00:58:16.940
Do you think sweet speeches are enough?

00:58:16.940 --> 00:58:19.170
to convince them to take your side?

00:58:20.840 --> 00:58:22.340
You are a fool.

00:58:22.910 --> 00:58:25.080
It's time to wake up and realize reality.

00:58:40.690 --> 00:58:42.230
What audacity!

00:58:45.200 --> 00:58:47.370
How dare you insult the king like that?

00:58:48.030 --> 00:58:51.340
This is betrayal and treason!

00:58:51.340 --> 00:58:53.740
How unlike you, Your Majesty. Calm down!

00:58:53.740 --> 00:58:56.110
How dare you order the king?

00:59:06.690 --> 00:59:10.620
Your Majesty, it seems there is something you are counting on.

00:59:10.790 --> 00:59:13.190
Whatever it is,
you won't be able to use it,

00:59:13.960 --> 00:59:16.160
if you lose your limbs.

00:59:18.000 --> 00:59:21.030
You will have to pay for your recklessness.

00:59:26.870 --> 00:59:29.580
For your crimes you will be beheaded.

00:59:34.310 --> 00:59:37.450
Your Majesty, we must follow military law.

00:59:38.120 --> 00:59:39.490
They are guilty of treason, which means

00:59:39.490 --> 00:59:41.390
this case is beyond the jurisdiction of the royal guard.

00:59:41.390 --> 00:59:43.320
The Detective Department will deal with this issue!

00:59:48.860 --> 00:59:49.860
Your Majesty!

00:59:51.230 --> 00:59:52.830
The Royal Guard will handle this!

00:59:52.830 --> 00:59:55.200
-We protest, Your Majesty!
-We protest, Your Majesty!

00:59:55.640 --> 00:59:59.340
The head of the royal guard knew who they really were!

00:59:59.470 --> 01:00:02.510
Maybe everyone on the guard is traitors.

01:00:02.510 --> 01:00:04.810
The royal guards must not be allowed to investigate

01:00:04.810 --> 01:00:05.910
what happened inside her!

01:00:05.910 --> 01:00:08.750
-Change your decision, Your Majesty!
-Change your decision, Your Majesty!

01:00:08.750 --> 01:00:11.180
Change your mind, Your Majesty!

01:00:23.000 --> 01:00:24.560
We can disband the royal guard

01:00:24.560 --> 01:00:27.330
and judge its commander.

01:00:27.330 --> 01:00:28.370
However,

01:00:30.040 --> 01:00:32.870
if you instruct me to punish criminals,

01:00:33.370 --> 01:00:37.440
I will take this as a promise not to do anything else

01:00:38.610 --> 01:00:40.650
and I'll leave it at that.

01:01:04.470 --> 01:01:05.670
No matter what I do

01:01:07.910 --> 01:01:09.110
nothing will change.

01:01:12.350 --> 01:01:14.080
What do you wish, Your Majesty?

01:01:26.660 --> 01:01:27.730
Fine.

01:01:32.670 --> 01:01:34.130
I'm giving this case

01:01:38.300 --> 01:01:39.440
into your hands.

01:04:01.680 --> 01:04:04.280
Lord of the Earth

01:04:05.420 --> 01:04:08.650
and lord of the harvest, I pray thee.

01:04:10.220 --> 01:04:12.260
Bless us

01:04:13.030 --> 01:04:16.730
may the crops be rich in harvest.

01:04:17.600 --> 01:04:21.100
May your mercy be

01:04:25.340 --> 01:04:27.640
to help the people of this land
and may he never know hunger.

01:04:36.820 --> 01:04:37.850
Please.

01:05:29.140 --> 01:05:31.070
-Your Majesty!
-Your Majesty!

01:05:47.050 --> 01:05:51.120
How I became queen

01:06:06.910 --> 01:06:09.480
The explosion damaged his hearing.

01:06:09.480 --> 01:06:10.540
Oh no.

01:06:10.940 --> 01:06:13.150
-There won't be any problems, will there?
-Certainly.

01:06:13.150 --> 01:06:14.580
Is no one behind this?

01:06:14.580 --> 01:06:16.620
I decided to survive

01:06:16.620 --> 01:06:17.820
so don't die.

01:06:17.820 --> 01:06:19.320
Recover as if nothing happened

01:06:19.320 --> 01:06:20.590
and I can stab you in the back.

01:06:20.590 --> 01:06:23.220
The internal enemy is always scary.

01:06:23.220 --> 01:06:25.260
Your Majesty! His Majesty...

01:06:25.930 --> 01:06:27.390
His Majesty...

01:06:27.690 --> 01:06:30.700
I suggest you end the regency.

01:06:30.700 --> 01:06:31.760
Your Majesty!

01:06:31.760 --> 01:06:34.870
Everyone in this palace killed Kim Soyeon.
